	<<else>>
		<<link [[걱정하도록 내버려 둔다|Gwylan Hypnosis Slumber Anxiety]]>><</link>><<gggtrauma>><<gwylanHypnoEffect>><<willpowerdifficulty $slumberDifficultyLow $slumberDifficultyHigh>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[곪아 터지게 내버려 둔다|Gwylan Hypnosis Slumber Anxiety]]>><<set $phase to "wake">><</link>>
